    "created_at": "2026-07-17T10:52:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-17T10:52:24Z",
    "body": "In addition to fixing the inaccuracy with https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12658, it would be useful to add a clarification that \"foreign content\" is _not_ an insertion mode but and adjacent token parsing mechanism.",
